        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>limited visibility</strong>, a <strong>ticking timer</strong>, and <strong>multiple connected screens</strong>, you’ll need to memorize the maze, act fast, think ahead, and find an optimal path to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a risk for score, expand your vision to plan ahead, or rush the exit before time runs out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short levels</strong>, <strong>quick retries</strong>, and <strong>score-based progression</strong> make each attempt a chance to improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics </strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost -</strong> Hit the turbo! Blaze through obstacles with a burst of speed and full-on invincibility!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.poster.avif?t=1785863130\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.webm?t=1785863130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.mp4?t=1785863130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vision -</strong> Widen your vision and slow down time to expose sneaky shortcuts or give you those extra seconds to react!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a9821edec2e34f4adf638ed1d3ad74f0.poster.avif?t=1785863130\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://sh